      "id": "isolation-boundaries-text-13",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 504,
      "y": 156,
      "width": 262.21200000000005,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "The container ships only the utilities for its\nown classes, wrapped by the build in\n@scope ([data-mfe-scope=\"operations\"])\n  to ([data-mfe-scope]).\n\nThe shell keeps the document half: preflight,\nthe fonts, @property, the theme variables.",
      "originalText": "The container ships only the utilities for its\nown classes, wrapped by the build in\n@scope ([data-mfe-scope=\"operations\"])\n  to ([data-mfe-scope]).\n\nThe shell keeps the document half: preflight,\nthe fonts, @property, the theme variables.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
