      "id": "isolation-boundaries-text-25",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 504,
      "y": 646,
      "width": 274.824,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "Every failure is an MfeError carrying a code\nfrom a closed union, the definition id, the\noperation and the repair to make.\n\nIt reaches the shell’s DiagnosticsHub, which\nforwards it to telemetry. A failed mount costs\nits own boundary and nothing else.",
      "originalText": "Every failure is an MfeError carrying a code\nfrom a closed union, the definition id, the\noperation and the repair to make.\n\nIt reaches the shell’s DiagnosticsHub, which\nforwards it to telemetry. A failed mount costs\nits own boundary and nothing else.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
